      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "say again",
      "grammar": "phrase",
      "comment": "The plain way: <span lang=\"la\">Dīc iterum</span>, say it again. Traupman 34 has <span lang=\"la\">eīsdem verbīs mihi redde</span> for “repeat after me”."
